{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04083","headline":"利州北佛龛前重于去岁题处作 · 苏頲","name":"利州北佛龛前重于去岁题处作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重岩载看美，分塔起层标。\n蜀守经涂处，巴人作礼朝。\n地疑三界出，空是六尘销。\n卧石铺苍藓，行塍覆绿条。\n岁年书有记，非爲学题桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}